ivalent.</div><div>•Aggregates: Stone chips for all pilling columns, grade beams, foundation, floor beams.</div><div>•Bricks: First Class Bricks/Auto Bricks.</div><div>•Sand: Sylhet Sand (FM-2.5) &amp; Local Sand (FM-1.50).</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>MAIN DOOR-</b></div><div>•Door Frame: Solid Chittagong Teak wooden decorative main entrance door.</div><div>•Door Shutter: Imported Malaysian Solid wooden.</div><div>• Accessories: Handle Lock, Security Lock, Tower Bolt, Check Viewer, Door Knocker, Apt. number plate, Door Chain etc.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>INTERNAL DOOR-</b></div><div>•Door Frame: 100% Seasoned Mehegoni wood with front side face molding.</div><div>•Door Shutter: Crown Teak Veneered Flush Door with Best Quality French Polish.</div><div>•All Bath Door Frame &amp; Shutter-Special Quality UPVC/WPC. </div><div>•Accessories: Mortise/ Round Lock, Magnetic Stopper, Check Viewer, Tower Bolt, Hinj Etc.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>CAT DOOR-</b></div><div>•Door Frame: Special Quality UPVC/WPC. </div><div>•Door Shutter: Special Quality UPVC/WPC.<br><br><br></div><div><b>WINDOWS</b></div><div>•All windows will be 4" high bottom KAI/ BTA/ Altec brand aluminum frame, sliding, shutter with 5mm clear glass with rubber channel &amp; mohair lining and MS square bar grill (12mm x 12mm) with mosquito proofing net provision.</div><div>•External windows to have rain water protective seal.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div><b>WALL-</b></div><div>•All internal wall will be 5" thick and external walls will be 5"/10" thick solid auto bricks and 1st Class bricks with Fair face plastering work.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>ELECTRICAL-</b></div><div>•Sub-Station will be install as per Load Calculation.</div><div>•Concealed electrical wiring with BRB/BBS/ Citizen or equivalent cable.</div><div>•MK/Energypac or equivalent electrical switches, sockets.</div><div>•Circuit breakers will be Le-grand/Havels or Equivalent. </div><div>•SDB Board-Local Best Quality.</div><div>•Intercom System with Panasonic / Siemens. </div><div>•Fire Extinguisher-1 nos Fitting in each Floor.</div><div>•Provision for concealed TV &amp; dish connection in master bedroom, child bedroom &amp; living room.</div><div>•Internet connection provision in living room.</div><div>•AC Provision in Master Bed, Child Bed, Living Room, Guest Room &amp; Dinning Room.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>PAINT-</b></div><div>•Plastic paint with Berger /Asian paint or equivalent on all internal wall, ceiling.</div><div>•Weather Coat Paint /Master Coat with Berger / Asian Paint or Equivalent on External surface.</div><div>•Enamel paint with Berger / Asian Paint or Equivalent on all M/S surface.</div><div>•Best Quality French polish on all wooden surface.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>GENERAL FLOOR &amp; VERANDA-</b></div><div>•32"x32" foreign standard local made RAK/ CBC/ DBL/AKIJ or equivalent mirror polish tiles in all general floors and veranda 4" skirting in all floor area well designed veranda mild steel made railing proper sloping for rainwater and 6" barrier.<br><br><div><br></div><div><b>BATHROOM</b></div><div>•Good quality RAK/DBL/Charu or equivalent high commode &amp; basin for all bathrooms, pan lowdown for servant bathroom. Master bathroom will be cabinet basin with marble work top and other bathrooms will be pedestal basin.</div><div>•Glazed Wall Tiles (12"x20"/12"x24") RAK/ Akij/ Fu-Wang/ GW/CBC/Mir/Charu or equivalent tiles up to 7 feet for all bathrooms.</div><div>•RAK / Akij/ GW/ CBC/ Charu or equivalent matching floor tiles in all bathrooms.</div><div>•Geyser provision in master bath, child bath and guest bath.</div><div>•Normal water provision in other bathroom &amp; servant bath. </div><div>•Standard size looking glass in all bathrooms except servant bath.</div><div>•Best quality Nazma/ Sattar/Sharif showerheads, towel rail, soap cases, tissue paper holder, glass self, stopcock, bib cock etc. will be provided in all bathrooms.</div><div>•Essentially correct uniform floor slope towards water outlet.</div><div>•Exhaust fan provision in Master, Child &amp; Guest bath.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>KITCHEN-</b></div><div>•Double burner gas point over impressively designed with RCC slab with granite top.</div><div>•One high polish stainless steel sink with sink mixer.</div><div>•12"x20"/12"x24" RAK/ Akij/ GW/ CBC/ Charu or equivalent wall tiles up to 7\' height &amp; matching floor tiles.</div><div>•Kitchen hood provision.</div><div>•Exhaust Fan provision.</div><div>•Geyser Provision.<br><br><div><br></div><div><b>UTILITIES-</b></div><div>•Residential Power supply with separate meter for each apartment.</div><div>•All service line (electricity, sewerage, water, gas etc.) shall be concealed &amp; tastefully covered.</div><div>•Water supply with a common meter from wasa.</div><div>•Gas connection from Titas. (Subject to provision by the Govt.)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>BUILDING ENTRANCE-</b></div><div>•Specious entrance and driveway with security provisions. Proper arrangement for control of incoming and outgoing persons, vehicles &amp; goods etc. Entrance &amp; driveway will be pavement tiles. Gardening provision at side of building. Heavy secured gate as per Architectural design including decorative lamp post. Building name &amp; Logos on polish tiles.<br><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," style="width: 516px;" data-filename="image.png"><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>APARTMENT LAYOUT-</b></div><div>•Total layout thoroughly arranged to maximize advantage, especially in relation to the daylight from all sides and cross ventilation throughout. Privacy has been emphasized by spreading the layout from end to end. All rooms can take advantage of both the winter sunlight and cool summer breeze.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>GROUND FLOOR-</b></div><div>•Elegant reception desk, guard room, drivers waiting room, highlight logo, Electromechanical room, wash room, car parking, number palate for parking place allocation &amp; gardening provision etc. Combined water meter &amp; sewerage line in ground floor.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>FIRE FIGHTING OF THE COMPLEX-</b></div><div>•Fire extinguisher in each floor (Stair Landing Area) according to the necessary firefighting requirement.</div><div>•Fire bucket and fire extinguisher will be in Substation Room.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>LIFT-</b></div><div>•01 (one) superior with high-speed Korean origin Sigma/ LG/Hyundai/Otis/Mitsubishi or equivalent lift of reputed manufactures to be with capacity of 08 passengers.<br><br><div><br></div><div><b>STAIR CASE-</b></div><div>•Best quality 12" x 24" or standard size AKIJ/DBL/RAK/CBC or Equivalent stair tiles &amp; stair railing made by SS Stair Railing/MS Framing with SS hand Rail.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>ROOF TOP-</b></div><div>• Protective 4\' height 5" thick brick parapet wall, water &amp; heat proofing finished roof top with well-designed rain water drainage system, protected children\'s area, gardening provision &amp; sitting arrangement, cloth drying area, BBQ area, Zen garden with sitting arrangement etc.<br><img src="data:image/png;base64," style="width: 501px;" data-filename="image.png"><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>General Disclaimer-</b></div><div>•All renderings are the artistic impression of the possible design and do not necessarily represent the final product. The company has the exclusive right to include or exclude any item of the feature and amenities of the apartment during the construction period.<br><br><br></div></div></div></div></div></div>',
