                'title' => 'Eden Bay',
                'description' => '<p data-start="0" data-end="489">Centrally located in Kolatoli, Cox’s Bazar, Eden Bay Hotel is a prestigious new addition by Bhaiya Group to the tourism hospitality sector of Bangladesh’s and the world’s most renowned tourist destination, Cox’s Bazar. With the growing demand for high-quality smart accommodations in Cox’s Bazar, Bhaiya Hotels & Resorts Limited has taken this timely initiative to offer local and international tourists a luxurious and unforgettable vacation experience in a world-class hotel environment.</p><p data-start="491" data-end="766">Bhaiya Hotels & Resorts Limited firmly believes that Eden Bay Hotel will soon become the first choice for tourist accommodation among travelers visiting Cox’s Bazar. At the same time, Eden Bay is expected to become highly significant from a commercial investment perspective.</p><h3 data-section-id="3aqcdn" data-start="768" data-end="792">Exclusive Facilities</h3><p>


