                'user_id' => 1,
                'name' => 'bay-front',
                'slug' => 'bay-front',
                'title' => 'Bay Front',
                'description' => '<div class="property-desc mb-4 pb-2" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto, " noto="" serif="" bengali",="" sans-serif;="" font-size:="" 18px;"=""><p data-path-to-node="0">Here is a beautifully structured and professional English translation of the text, perfect for a brochure, website, or promotional press release:</p><h2 data-path-to-node="2"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0">Bhaiya Hotels & Resorts Ltd. Introduces \'Bay Front Resort\' in Kuakata</b></h2><p data-path-to-node="3">This initiative has been launched through mutual collaboration with world-class hospitality management service providers to ensure premium accommodation and hospitality for both local and international tourists. Situated in Kuakata—one of the finest tourist destinations in Bangladesh—<b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="285">Bay Front Resort</b> is the latest addition to Bhaiya Group\'s premium tourism and hospitality services.</p><p data-path-to-node="4">Currently, Kuakata faces a shortage of high-quality, smart accommodations. To bridge this gap and offer domestic and foreign tourists a luxurious, captivating vacation experience in a world-class setting, Bhaiya Hotels & Resorts Limited has taken this timely step. The company firmly believes that the Bay Front Resort project will become the premier "tourist accommodation" of choice for travelers visiting Kuakata in the near future, while also emerging as a highly lucrative commercial venture.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">Exclusive Benefits</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Convenient Check-In / Check-Out:</b> Seamless and hassle-free arrival and departure.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Easy Ownership Registration:</b> A smooth and transparent process for property registration.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Luxurious Vacation Ownership:</b> Premium holiday ownership designed for ultimate comfort.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Exclusive Property Expansion:</b> Opportunities to grow and expand your property portfolio.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Lifetime Cash Flow:</b> Enjoy a steady, hassle-free stream of lifetime rental income.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,5,0" data-index-in-node="0">Hassle-Free Ownership Transfer:</b> Flexible and uncomplicated property transfer options.</p></li></ul></div>',
                'description_1' => '<blockquote data-path-to-node="10" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><p data-path-to-node="10,0"><span data-path-to-node="10,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Hospitality & Personal Care</span></p><ul data-path-to-node="10,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0,0">24/7 Dedicated Butler Service</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,1,0">Multilingual Staff</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,2,0">Babysitting & Child Care Services</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,3,0">Specialized Consultation Service</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,4,0">In-House Florist</p></li></ul></blockquote><blockquote data-path-to-node="11" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><p data-path-to-node="11,0"><span data-path-to-node="11,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Business & VIP Privileges</span></p><ul data-path-to-node="11,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0,0">VIP Lounge Access</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0">High-Speed Internet Connectivity</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,2,0">Fully-Equipped Business Center</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,3,0">Private Meeting & Event Spaces</p></li></ul></blockquote><blockquote data-path-to-node="12" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><p data-path-to-node="12,0"><span data-path-to-node="12,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Travel & Convenience</span></p><ul data-path-to-node="12,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0,0">Limousine & Chauffeur Services</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,1,0">Express Check-In / Check-Out</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,2,0">Digital Environment Control System</p></li></ul></blockquote><blockquote data-path-to-node="13" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><p data-path-to-node="13,0"><span data-path-to-node="13,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Leisure & Recreation</span></p><ul data-path-to-node="13,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="13,1,0,0">Exclusive Private Beach Acces