                'description' => '<div class="property-desc mb-4 pb-2" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto, " noto="" serif="" bengali",="" sans-serif;="" font-size:="" 18px;"=""><h2 data-path-to-node="2"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0">Bhaiya Hotels & Resorts Ltd. Introduces "Greenwich Hill Station" in Sylhet</b></h2><h2 data-path-to-node="2"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0"><br></b></h2><p data-path-to-node="3">This initiative has been launched in collaboration with world-class hospitality management service providers to ensure premium accommodation and hospitality for both domestic and international tourists. <b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="203">"Greenwich Hill Station"</b> is the latest prestigious addition to the Bhaiya Hotels & Resorts portfolio.</p><p data-path-to-node="4">Currently, Sylhet faces a shortage of high-quality, smart accommodations for travelers. To bridge this gap and offer local and global tourists a luxurious and breathtaking resort experience, Bhaiya Hotels & Resorts Limited has taken this timely step. The company firmly believes that "Greenwich Hill Station" will soon become the premier, top-tier tourist accommodation of choice for travelers visiting Sylhet, while also emerging as a highly lucrative commercial venture.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">Exclusive Benefits</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Convenient Check-In / Check-Out:</b> Seamless and hassle-free arrival and departure.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Easy Ownership Registration:</b> A smooth, transparent property registration process.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Luxurious Vacation Ownership:</b> Premium holiday ownership designed for ultimate comfort.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Exclusive Property Expansion:</b> Excellent opportunities to grow your property portfolio.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Lifetime Cash Flow:</b> Enjoy a steady, hassle-free stream of lifetime rental income.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,5,0" data-index-in-node="0">Hassle-Free Ownership Transfer:</b> Flexible and uncomplicated property transfer options.</p></li></ul></div>',
                'description_1' => '<blockquote data-path-to-node="10" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><p data-path-to-node="10,0"><span data-path-to-node="10,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Leisure & Wellness</span></p><ul data-path-to-node="10,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="10,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Infinity Pool</span> – Swim with a breathtaking view.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="10,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Spa & Wellness Center</span> – Rejuvenate your mind and body.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,2,0"><span data-path-to-node="10,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Fitness Center</span> – Fully equipped for your health and workout needs.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,3,0"><span data-path-to-node="10,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Meditation Pavilion</span> – A serene space for peace and mindfulness.</p></li></ul></blockquote><blockquote data-path-to-node="11" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><p data-path-to-node="11,0"><span data-path-to-node="11,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Entertainment & Recreation</span></p><ul data-path-to-node="11,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="11,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Rooftop Lounge & Rooftop Garden</span> – Perfect settings for relaxation and skyline views.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Indoor Amusement Area</span> – Fun-filled indoor games and activities.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,2,0"><span data-path-to-node="11,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Kids’ Splash Pool & Children’s Play Area</span> – Safe and exciting spaces for young ones.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,3,0"><span data-path-to-node="11,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Landscaped Gardens</span> – Beautifully manicured green spaces for peaceful strolls.</p></li></ul></blockquote><blockquote data-path-to-node="12" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><p data-path-to-node="12,0"><span data-path-to-node="12,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Accommodation, Dining & Events</span></p><ul data-path-to-node="12,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="12,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Private Villas</span> – Exquisite, secluded stays for ultimate privacy.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="12,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Fine Dining Restaurant</span> – World-class culinary experiences.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,2,0"><span data-path-to-node="12,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">Grand Event Hall</span> – Ideal for corporate gatherings, weddings, and celebrations.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,3,0"><span data-path-to-node="12,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-weight: bolder;">24/7 Concierge Service</span> – Around-the-clock dedicated assistance.</p></li></ul></blockquote>',
