            [
                'old_id' => 54,
                'module' => 'project',
                'parent_id' => 5,
                'destination_id' => 53,
                'user_id' => 1,
                'name' => 'southern-centre',
                'slug' => 'southern-centre',
                'title' => 'Southern Centre',
                'description' => '<h1><b>SOUTHERN CENTRE</b></h1><p>Secure and well-planned integrated SOUTH FACING neighborhood of SOUTHERN CENTER. You will be living so close of all vibrant places, taste of living in a central zone of Rajarbag. Here everything is just minutes away- schools, shopping malls, hospitals, exclusive restaurants, banks, national &amp; multinational offices, what not! You will enjoy comfortable nice long walk; children can play safely all year through. The lush green and beautiful open spaces surrounding you promote a lifestyle of uncompromising quality along with excellent recreational facilities that help you unwind any time.<br></p><p><b>Project Features:</b><br></p><ul><li>Address: 17-19, Outer Circular Road, Rajarbag, Dhaka</li><li>Land Area: 14.65 Katha</li><li>Building Height: 18 storied building (3 BM+GF+ 17 Floors)</li><li>Building Type: Commercial cum Residential Facing: South</li><li>Residential Part: 3rd to 17th floor</li><li>Unit Per Floor: 4 Units</li><li>Total Apartment: 60 Nos</li><li>Size of Apartments: Type A: 1790 sq.ft.(Approx)</li><li>Type B: 1825 sq.ft. (Approx)</li><li>&nbsp;Type C: 1360 sq.ft.(Approx)</li><li>Type D: 1250 sq.ft. (Approx)</li><li>Commercial Floor: 1st to 2nd floor</li><li>Total Parking: 72 nos<br></li></ul><p><b>ATTRACTIVE FEATURE\'S are</b></p><ul><li>Unblocked SUNLIGHT</li><li>Life Time SOUTH OPEN, more than 0.65 kilomiter</li><li>Rooftop SWIMMING POOL</li><li>&nbsp;KIDS PLAY area</li><li>Abandent Multipurpose HALLROOM (2nd floor)&nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp;Modern GYM</li><li>INDOOR GAME Corner</li><li>Grand entry way</li><li>Rooftop GARDEN.</li><li>Enough GREEN SPACE all around the building.</li><li>&nbsp;LAVISH RECEPTION &amp; waiting lobby at ground floor. 2 high speed lifts (10 passenger)</li><li>Most ENSURED SAFETY FEATURE with</li><li>modern fire fighting system.</li><li>24 hours Security with CCTV</li></ul>',
                'description_1' => '<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-filename="image.png" style="width: 354px;"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><b>BUILDING ENTRANCE</b></p><p>Secured decorative MS decorative main & pocket gate with lamp posts as per the elevation and perspective of the building.</p><ul><li>Project name with polished marble or granite & logo stylish letter on attractive background.</li><li>Security control and guard room.</li><li>Gardening and plantation area.</li><li>CC camera protected ground floor and entrance.</li><li>Comfortable and functional internal drive way.</li><li> Toilets for guards and drivers in the ground floor.</li></ul><p><b>RECEPTION</b></p><p>Impressive reception desk with granite/marble finished. 24" x 24" Tiled floor in reception area. Pabx/intercom system connection with each apartment. Separate mailbox for each apartment.</p><p><b>LIFT</b></p><ul><li>02 (two) superior 10 (ten) persons capacity lift from world reputed manufacturer "Sigma/LG/Hyundai or equivalent" to serve every floor.</li><li>Decorative cabin, doors and adequate lighting.</li><li>Lift to have emergency alarm, safety device and intercom.</li><li> Lift wall designed with marble/Foreign tiles at ground floor and other lift wall will be marble textured 10" X 16" RAK/DBL/x-Monica/cbc or equivalent tiled.</li><li> Specious lift lobby on each floor with marble textured 24" x 24" RAK/ DBL/X-Monica/cbc or equivalent tiled floor.</li><li> Inside the lift core wall will be plastered for brick wall and as cast for RCC surface.</li></ul><p><b>STAIR & LOBBY</b></p><ul><li>Homogeneous nosing RAK/x-monica/CBC or equivalent 12" X 12" stair tiles (step & riser) in staircase.</li><li>Designed stainless steel hand rail with Mild Steel railing throughout the</li><li>staircase.</li><li>Homogeneous RAK/x-monica/CBC or equivalent 16" X 16" floor tiles in all lobby and landing.</li><li>Adequate lighting in staircase.</li></ul><p><b>APARTMENT LAYOUT</b></p><ul><li> Basic apartment layout focuses on availing the predominately natural environment of deltaic Bangladesh.</li><li>Emphasis is given to bring more natural light and ventilation to the apartment unit. </li><li>Privacy is emphasized on in designing the layout so that the master and 2nd bed room are located away from the guest bed room and main entertainment areas.</li></ul><div><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-filename="image.png" style="width: 541px;"><br></div>',
                'body_3' => null,
                'body_4' => null,
                'meta_title' => 'Southern Centre Apartment at  Rajarbagh | Bhaiya Housing Ltd',
                'meta_description' => 'Southern Centre Secure and well-planned integrated SOUTH FACING neighborhood of SOUTHERN CENTER. You will be living so close of all vibrant places, taste of living in a central zone of Rajarbag. Here everything is just minutes away- schools, shopping malls, hospitals, exclusive restaurants, banks, national & multinational offices, what not! You will enjoy comfortable nice long walk; children can play safely all year through. The lush green and beautiful open spaces surrounding you promote a lifestyle of uncompromising quality along with excellent recreational facilities that help you unwind any time.',
                'meta_keywords' => null,
                'img_path' => 'images/178046511799818.pdf',
