                'title' => 'Velvet Vista',
                'description' => '<p>Discover <b>VELVET VISTA</b> by Bhaiya Housing, an exqui- site residential haven in Jolshiri Abashon. Positioned amidst serene landscapes and modern conveni- ences, VELVET VISTA offers an unparalleled blend of tranquility and accessibility.</p><p>This development is not just a place to live but a cele- bration of refined elegance and contemporary design, inspired by the classic charm of its namesake, a symbol of grace and harmony from literature.</p><p>At <b>VELVET VISTA</b>, embrace a lifestyle where every detail is crafted to perfection, and every moment is an experience of unparalleled luxury and comfort. Wel- come to a new chapter of living, where the beauty of nature and the sophistication of urban life come together in perfect harmony.</p><p><br></p><p><b>VELVET VISTA Features:</b></p><p>• Corner Plot<br>• Double Height Entry.<br>• Visitor\'s Waiting Lounge.<br>• Community Lounge.<br>• Office Space.<br>• Rooftop Walking Loop.<br>• Rooftop Garden.<br>. Open to Sky Leisure Zone.<br>• Roof top BBQ,<br>• Modern Fire Safty System.<br>• Hi Speed Lift (8 Passenger).<br>• 360° Security.<br>• Naturally Lighted & Airy.<br>• Bathrooms & Kitchen Have Separate Hot Water Provision.<br><br></p><h5 style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);"><b>Velvet vista Apartment Amenities:</b></h5><h6><b>Building Entrance-</b></h6><p>Secured decorative MS decorative main & pocket gate with lamp posts as per the elevation and perspective of the building.</p><p>•Project name with polished marble or granite & logo stylish letter on attractive background.<br><br>• Security control and guard room.</p><p>• Gardening and plantation area.</p><p>• CC camera protected ground floor and entrance.</p><p>• Comfortable and functional internal drive way.</p><p>• Toilets for guards and drivers in the ground floor.</p><p><b>General Floor And Veranda-</b></p><p>• 32" x 32" foreign standard local made RAK/CBC/DBL/Akij or equivalent homogeneous tiles in all general floors and veranda. 4" skirting in all floor area. Well designed veranda mild steel made railing. Proper sloping for rain water and 6" barrier.</p><p><b>Roof Top With Green Surface-</b></p><p>• Protective parapet walls.</p><p>• Planters walkway.</p><p>• Quality roof top finishers to make the roof as water proof area.</p><p>• Seating area.</p><p>• Engineering treatment for natural heating and water dampness.<br><br></p><p><b>Reception-</b></p><p>Impressive reception desk. Tiled in reception area. Pabx/intercom system connection with each apartment.<br><br></p><p><b>Car Parking And Driveway-</b></p><p>• Functional comfortable drive way with pavement tiles.</p><p>• Reserved car marking.</p><p>• Column protected metal guards.</p><p>• Car parking facility will be available at ground floor.</p><p>• Car charging facility will be available at ground floor.<br><br></p><p><b>Lift-</b></p><p>• 01 (one) superior 8 (eight) person\'s capacity lift from world reputed manufacturer "Sigma/LG/Hyundai/Otis/Mitsubishi or equivalent" to serve every floor. <br>Decorative cabin, doors and adequate lighting.</p><p>• Lift to have emergency alarm, safety device and intercom.</p><p>• Lift wall designed with marble tiles at ground floor and other lift wall will be marble textured 12" X 24" RAK/DBL/X-Monica/cbc or equivalent tiled.</p><p>• Specious lift lobby on each floor with marble textured 24" x 24" RAK/ DBL/X-Monica/cbc or equivalent tiled floor.</p><p>• Inside the lift core wall will be plastered for brick wall and as cast for RCC surface.<br><br></p><p><b>Generator-</b></p><p>International (UK) standard generator (zonseng/perkins or equivalent). Sufficient KVA capacity to cover:</p><p>• Common area lights like car parking spaces, main gate, staircase, lift lobby, security room, intercom service.</p><p>01(one) light and 01(one) fan point at each living, dining, master and child bedroom and 01 (one) light point at kitchen and 3 toilets per apartment.</p><p>• 01(One) lift and water pump.<br><br></p><p><b>Stair & Lobby-</b></p><p>Homogeneous nosing RAK/x-monica/CBC or equivalent 12" X 24" stair tiles (step & riser) in staircase.</p><p>• Designed wooden hand rail with Mild Steel railing throughout the staircase.</p><p>• Homogeneous RAK/x-monica/CBC or equivalent 24" X 24" floor tiles in all lobby and landing.</p><p>• Adequate lighting in staircase.<br><br></p><p><b>Apartment Layout-</b></p><p>• Basic apartment layout focuses on availing the predominately natural environment of deltaic Bangladesh.</p><p>• Emphasis is given to bring more natural light and ventilation to the apartment unit.</p><p>• Privacy is emphasized on in designing the layout so that the master and 02 bed rooms are located away from the guest bed room and main entertainment areas. SUB-STATION:</p><p>• A Substation on the ground floor. Brand:</p><p>Edison Power/Adex/United Shakti.</p><p>. Sub Station Equipment\'s:</p><p>• Transformer - rating as per equipment.</p><p>.HT switch gear (LBS).</p><p>• Power Factor Improvement (PFI) Plant if required.</p><p>Drop Out Fuse (DOF).</p><p>Lightening Arrestor (LA) and</p><p>Heat Shrink</p>',
